---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { url, styles, rooms, sceneImage } from '../../data/site';
---
<SiteLayout title="Interior Design" description="Compare four design directions for Immortals Macau across the same six clinic spaces." active="interior-design">
<section class="wrap page-heading"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={url()}>Macau flagship</a><span>/</span><span>Interior Design</span></div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE ATMOSPHERE</p><div class="page-heading-grid"><h1>One ambition.<br /><span>Four atmospheres.</span></h1><div><p>Each direction gives the same clinic a different character. Compare the spaces side by side, then step into the details of the one that speaks to you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="#compare">Compare the rooms <span>↓</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap style-hero"><div class="style-grid">{styles.map((s,i)=><a class="style-card" href={url(`interior-design/${s.slug}/`)}><div class="style-card-image"><img src={sceneImage(s.id,'main-entrance',true)} alt={`${s.name} main entrance`} width="600" height="338" loading={i>1?'lazy':'eager'} /></div><div class="style-card-line"><span>0{i+1} / {s.character}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.summary}</p><div class="swatch-line" aria-hidden="true">{s.swatches.map(c=><span style={`background:${c}`}></span>)}</div></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="cream"><div class="wrap section"><div class="chapter-line"><span>THE SHARED BRIEF</span><span>DIFFERENT EXPRESSION / THE SAME INTENTION</span></div><div class="design-principles"><div><h3>An arrival with presence.</h3><p>The double-height main entrance should create a genuine sense of occasion, while remaining an inviting threshold from the city.</p></div><div><h3>A quieter private world.</h3><p>Suites feel personal and composed. A separate entrance allows a more discreet arrival into the clinical side of the visit.</p></div><div><h3>Care, integrated.</h3><p>Treatment rooms and assessment equipment belong within the architectural language, with their practical requirements informing the final design.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="compare"><div class="chapter-line"><span>THE COMPARISON</span><span>SAME ROOM / FOUR DIRECTIONS</span></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Change the room.<br />Compare the feeling.</h2><p>Select a space to see all four interpretations. Open any image for a closer look, or explore a direction in full.</p></div><div class="comparison-tools" role="group" aria-label="Room to compare">{rooms.map((r,i)=><button class="chip" data-compare-room={r.id} aria-pressed={i===0}>{r.name}</button>)}</div><p id="comparison-room-label" class="eyebrow" aria-live="polite">MAIN ENTRANCE / ALL FOUR DIRECTIONS</p><div class="comparison-grid" style="margin-top:22px">{styles.map(s=><article class="comparison-card" data-style={s.id}><button class="image-button" data-lightbox={sceneImage(s.id)} data-caption={`${s.name} · Main entrance`} aria-label={`Enlarge ${s.name} main entrance`}><img src={sceneImage(s.id)} alt={`${s.name} · Main entrance`} width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" /><span>View full image ↗</span></button><div><h3>{s.name}</h3><a class="text-link" href={url(`interior-design/${s.slug}/`)}>Explore direction <span>↗</span></a></div></article>)}</div><p class="fine comparison-note">Concept visualisations illustrate atmosphere, material and design intent. Room proportions, equipment clearances and final arrangements need architectural and technical coordination.</p></section>
<section class="closing cream"><p class="eyebrow">DESIGN MEETS THE PLAN</p><h2>The atmosphere changes.<br />The footprint is shared.</h2><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={url('layout/')}>Explore the three layouts <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<script>
 const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-compare-room]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
 const room=button.dataset.compareRoom!;const name=button.textContent!;
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-compare-room]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button)));
 document.querySelector('#comparison-room-label')!.textContent=`${name} / All four directions`;
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.comparison-card').forEach(card=>{const image=card.querySelector('img')!;const trigger=card.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-lightbox]')!;const caption=`${card.querySelector('h3')!.textContent} · ${name}`;image.src=`${base}assets/scenes/${card.dataset.style}/${room}.webp`;image.alt=caption;trigger.dataset.lightbox=image.src;trigger.dataset.caption=caption;trigger.setAttribute('aria-label',`Enlarge ${caption}`);});
 }));
</script>
</SiteLayout>
